  "bodyHash": "F+9rUmha/RM=",
  "content": "<h1>Minecraft 電影結構🍗/🧶/🍄‍🟫/🟣</h1><p><strong>這個模組</strong>&nbsp;為&nbsp;<strong>Minecraft 新增了熔岩雞結構</strong>，生成在&nbsp;<strong>平原生態域</strong>中，直接將&nbsp;<strong>Minecraft 電影中的場景帶入原始遊戲</strong>，同時還新增了&nbsp;<strong>「熔岩雞 - Hyper Potions」唱片</strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/23f52b2bd2f5457323d2bd5224beb73d93c70249.png\" alt=\"熟雞肉\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9902cd3cbf61eefcea13675a1fc6ce260492101a.jpeg\" alt=\"熔岩雞結構\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ba210e4ac56eec2d5d76e0cb1563d631fee0d7c4.jpeg\" alt=\"粉紅小屋宣傳圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cba1f3fcd7d5e444a4c9c2587f117762ee6fa99c.jpeg\" alt=\"蘑菇屋宣傳圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e49524d8bcff287c4c44eb855d848d7cde0e083.jpeg\" alt=\"古老傳送門宣傳圖\"></p><blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp © - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote><h2>備註📝 (Notes)</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Minecraft 電影結構</strong>&nbsp;<strong>相容</strong>&nbsp;於&nbsp;<strong>1.20 至 1.21.10</strong> 版本🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>1.20 至 1.21.6 版本中不會找到唱片，但會有自訂戰利品</strong>📌</li>\n<li><strong>Minecraft 電影結構</strong>&nbsp;在世界生成中新增了&nbsp;<strong>（結構）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>Minecraft 電影結構</strong>&nbsp;可與任何&nbsp;<strong>世界生成模組</strong>相容</li>\n<li><strong>建議使用耳機</strong>&nbsp;以獲得&nbsp;<strong>更佳體驗</strong>&nbsp;🎧</li>\n</ul><h1>描述 🎼 (Description)</h1><p>在原始 Minecraft 遊戲中享受更具沉浸感的體驗，<strong>新增了新的結構</strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/23f52b2bd2f5457323d2bd5224beb73d93c70249.png\" alt=\"熟雞肉\">&nbsp;為&nbsp;<strong>村莊及其結構</strong>增添更多背景故事🌎</p><h2>生成🌐 (Generation)</h2><p><strong>熔岩雞結構</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>平原</strong>，如果你想用&nbsp;<strong>指令定位，請使用：</strong></p><p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:lava_chicken</code></p><p><strong>粉紅羊毛屋結構</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>森林</strong>，如果你想用&nbsp;<strong>指令定位，請使用：</strong></p><p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:pink_wool_house</code></p><p><strong>蘑菇屋結構</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>黑森林</strong>，如果你想用&nbsp;<strong>指令定位，請使用：</strong></p><p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:mushroom_house</code></p><p><strong>古老傳送門結構</strong>&nbsp;生成於&nbsp;<strong>所有森林</strong>，如果你想用&nbsp;<strong>指令定位，請使用：</strong></p><p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:old_portal</code></p><blockquote>\n<p>更多結構即將推出..</p>\n</blockquote><h2>新成就 🏆 (New Advancements)</h2><p><strong>如果你找到結構</strong>，你將獲得一個&nbsp;<strong>新成就</strong>&nbsp;叫做&nbsp;<strong>「啦啦啦熔岩」和「嘰嘰嘰小雞..」</strong>&nbsp;並且會顯示如下：</p><p>◾&nbsp;<strong>圖片 (Image)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/23f52b2bd2f5457323d2bd5224beb73d93c70249.png\" alt=\"熟雞肉\">：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8238cbb0c24b1b8d8a31ad946ecb1e7ea8c92950.png\" alt=\"熔岩雞成就\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b3c48a534e05d5098f9f68e98f1547c6a33b9e7c.png\" alt=\"蘑菇屋成就\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c1266b044942d4860c361801182a6678760a984.png\" alt=\"古老傳送門成就\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
